# If you prefer the allow list template instead of the deny list, see community template:
# https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/community/Golang/Go.AllowList.gitignore
#
# Binaries for programs and plugins
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib

# Test binary, built with `go test -c`
*.test

# Code coverage profiles and other test artifacts
*.out
coverage.*
*.coverprofile
profile.cov

# Dependency directories (remove the comment below to include it)
# vendor/

# Go workspace file
go.work
go.work.sum

# env file
# .env.* 一并忽略，是为了盖住 .env.bak / .env.local 这类临时副本 ——
# 它们同样含密钥，而 .env 未被 git 跟踪，一旦误提交没有任何东西能兜底。
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# 首次启动时生成的 root 初始密码。程序在 users 表为空时写入，
# 权限虽然是 0600，但误提交到仓库就等于把管理员密码公开了。
root_initial_password.txt

# 镜像导出包（deploy/build-image.sh 的产物，落在仓库根目录）
*.tar.gz
# 开头的斜杠是必须的：不带斜杠的 "futureai-api" 会匹配任意层级，
# 把 deploy/futureai-api/ 也一并忽略掉。
/futureai-api

# Editor/IDE
# .idea/
# .vscode/
